	(microblaze_elf_reloc_type_lookup): Map the new BFD relocs.
	(microblaze_write_uleb128): New function.
	(microblaze_elf_relocate_section): Apply the ULEB128 pair.
	(microblaze_diff_reloc_p): Include the ULEB128 relocations.
